WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.5 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Data collection, ethics and data quality

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Collect only the data you need, ethically, in ways you can trust.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Use the simplest method that gives credible evidence.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask consent; take extra care with children.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Train collectors and spot-check a sample.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“A job placement counts only with a contract seen or the employer confirming; graduates not reached are recorded as 'not reached'.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your data collection plan and quality checks.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
